{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "团建活动策划助手",
    "description": "基于 LangGraph 编排的智能团建活动策划助手API",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/api/event/parse": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "团建活动策划"
        ],
        "summary": "需求解析: 原始文本 -> 结构化 EventRequest",
        "description": "自由文本入口(唯一会调 LLM 做抽取的端点): 抽取 人数/日期/预算/出发地/活动类型; 缺关键字段(人数/日期/出发地)或日期早于今天返回 400 + missing_fields, 不进入后续编排。表单类前端请改走 /plan 的结构化入参, 少一次 LLM 且不会抽错。",
        "operationId": "parse_event_api_event_parse_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EventParseBody"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EventRequest"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/event/plan": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "团建活动策划"
        ],
        "summary": "发起团建活动策划流程(HITL: 生成后暂停等待人工审批)",
        "description": "**结构化入参**(人数/日期/出发地必填; 预算=总预算; 日期=YYYY-MM-DD)。编排: 需求组装(零 LLM) -> 偏好聚合 -> 基础信息采集 -> 四路并行提案 -> reconcile 约束消解(回环) -> risk 风险评估 -> approval 人工审批(interrupt 暂停)。返回 thread_id + approval_payload; 用 POST /resume 提交审批结果继续流程。审批通过后走 checklist 任务清单 + memory 团队记忆写入。状态经 AsyncSqliteSaver 持久化到 backend/data/checkpoints.db, 跨进程可恢复。",
        "operationId": "plan_event_api_event_plan_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PlanStartBody"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PlanStartResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/event/resume": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "团建活动策划"
        ],
        "summary": "提交审批结果并恢复流程(HITL)",
        "description": "approved=True: Command(resume) 放行 -> 流程结束返回最终方案; approved=False+feedback: 意见写入 user_feedback -> 路由回 aggregate_prefs 重走, 意见注入四路提案 prompt, 生成后再次暂停等待审批。状态从 checkpoint 恢复, 支持进程重启后继续(thread_id 不变)。",
        "operationId": "resume_event_api_event_resume_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ResumeBody"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PlanStartResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/event/health": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "团建活动策划"
